== Effects ==
* Isaac can break [[obstacle]]s by walking into them.
* Increases Isaac's size.
* {{transformation contribution|Stompy}}

== Notes ==
* Walking into [[Bomb Rock]]s will cause them to explode.
* [[Mushroom (Obstacle)|Mushrooms]] may hurt Isaac with a poison cloud if walked into.
* [[Polyp]]s may hurt Isaac with blood shots or red creep if walked into.
* [[Flight]] does not prevent the effect from occurring.
* Holes in the ground can be filled if Isaac walks into adjacent rocks from the right direction, similar to bombs.
* {{E|TNT}} Barrels will not be destroyed or explode on contact, however {{E|Movable TNT}} Barrels will explode and may deal damage to Isaac if walked into.
* Allows Isaac to walk over and destroy {{E|Red Poop}} without taking damage. Isaac will still take damage if he is standing on it when it reforms.
* Walking into an Angel Statue in the {{R|Angel Room}} will trigger the boss fight, and Isaac will take damage as the Angel spawns on top of him.
* {{dlc|na+}} Nullifies effects of One Makes You Small [[pill]]s, One Makes You Larger pills, and other items which decrease size, such as {{i|Caffeine Pill}} and {{i|Binky|n}}.
* {{Dlc|r}} [[Rocks#Spiked Rocks|Spiked Rocks]] can be destroyed, but depending on Isaac's size, angle and velocity they may still hurt him.
* {{dlc+|r}} Isaac can crush {{e|Rock Spider}}s and {{e|Tinted Rock Spider}}s by stepping on them. Killing a Rock Spider this way ''will'' spawn a {{e|Spider}} which is extremely likely to deal damage to Isaac.{{dlc-}}

